 "confession_plain": "The AI's 'future test' ran from September 2024 to January 2026. The channel keeps a sealed vault: every bar from 1 June 2025 on, saved for a final exam. Eight of those seventeen months were inside the vault. The AI saw the overlap before it started, wrote it down, kept the split because its rules said not to change it without asking, and ran the test three times, on three versions. The files show no setting changed because of what it saw. But for this strategy the vault is no longer sealed, and here is what was inside: before the vault, version 6 made $1.93 for every $1 it lost (53 trades). Inside the vault, $1.18 (55 trades). From June to December 2025 it was down $420 over 50 trades; 5 trades in January 2026 made $6,775."
